## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY OF COMPLETED FEATURES & ARCHITECTURE

### A. Dynamic Role Assignment & Fisher-Yates Random Lottery
- Removed legacy forced selection of Survivor vs Zombie.
- Added Host Initial Zombies Stepper (1 to 10 zombies) with 100% random lottery at launch.
- Server executes a cryptographically fair Fisher-Yates permutation across all human players.
