- 15-Meter Sonar Warning: Plays proximity beep sound and pulses warning on survivor screen when a zombie enters 15 meters.

### D. 60-Second Out-of-Bounds Countdown & Elimination
- If any operative steps outside the arena boundary, a 60-second countdown timer initiates.
- Real-time countdown HUD warning displayed. If they re-enter the zone, countdown cancels safely.
- If 60 seconds expire while outside, the operative is eliminated / infected, and an event is posted to chat.

### E. Late Join Window (10-Minute Buffer)
- After a match starts, new players can join using the 6-character room code during the first 10 minutes.
- Automatically assigned as Survivor or Zombie based on balance rules.

### F. UI Cleanup & Performance Optimization
- Removed confusing Coin / Health economy options to keep real-life gameplay simple and focused.
- Removed outdated animated tutorials.
- Added Refresh Map & Recalibrate GPS button on HUD header and floating FAB on Leaflet map.
- Added Live Statistics Bar: Total Players, Survivors Alive, Zombies Hunting, Escaped.
