### **2. 60-Second Out-Of-Bounds Red Screen & Elimination**

* **Server Engine ([`game/server.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/server.js#L572-L585))**:
  * Tracks player distance from the arena center.
  * If a player crosses the boundary ($dist > radius$), the server initiates `outOfBoundsRemaining = 60` and sends live updates every second.
  * If the 60-second timer hits zero and the survivor has not returned, the server triggers an automatic elimination:
    ```javascript
    executeInfection(room, null, p, 'OUT_OF_BOUNDS_60S');
    ```
  * If the player re-enters the circle before 60 seconds, `outOfBounds` is cleared and the timer cancels immediately.
* **Client UI & Alerts ([`game/public/index.html`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/index.html#L25-L38) & [`game/public/style.css`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/style.css#L2982-L3080))**:
  * Added the full-screen emergency overlay `#out-of-bounds-overlay` with a pulsing red vignette, siren beacon, and live countdown (`60s`, `59s`...).
  * Triggers device vibration warnings when time is running low ($\le 10\text{s}$).

