### **1. 10-Minute Late Join Window (Implemented & Verified)**

New operatives can now join an active match during the **first 10 minutes** (`600 seconds`) after game launch:

* **How It Works**:
  * **Within 0 to 10 Minutes**: Any friend who enters the 6-letter room code joins immediately.
  * **Role Assignment**: Late joiners automatically deploy as **🏃 Survivors** with active radar blips so they immediately start running and surviving.
  * **Direct Deployment**: Their app skips the lobby and transitions straight into the live radar map (`screen-hunt`), with current time remaining, live zombie blips, and boundaries.
  * **Tactical Chat Broadcast**: When a late joiner enters, the server transmits a live deployment banner into everyone’s chat:
    $$\text{"🏃 OPERATIVE DEPLOYED: [Name] joined the active match as a Survivor!"}$$
  * **After 10 Minutes**: The entry window locks down. Any new attempt to join receives:
    $$\text{"Late entry window closed! New operatives can only join within the first 10 minutes."}$$
  * **Reconnection Exception**: Operatives who were *already in the match* and temporarily lost connection or battery can reconnect at **any time** throughout the game.

