### **2. Potential Bugs & Glitches Audited and Fixed**

During a code audit of the mobile gameplay loop, we identified and resolved 4 critical mobile quirks:

1. **Screen Sleep / Dimming While Running (Fixed)**:
   * *Problem*: In outdoor running games, players often hold their phones without touching the screen for 30–60 seconds. Android defaults to putting the screen to sleep after 30 seconds, which freezes the GPS chip and throttles WebSockets.
   * *Fix*: Implemented the **`Screen WakeLock API`** in [`game/public/app.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/app.js#L3070-L3095). The screen remains active and bright throughout the match, and automatically re-acquires the lock if the player tabs away and returns.
2. **Auto-Center Snapping When Dragging the Map (Fixed)**:
   * *Problem*: `gameMap.panTo([lat, lng])` was firing on every single GPS tick, violently snapping the map back to the player if they were trying to pan and inspect faraway landmarks or approaching zombies.
   * *Fix*: Added a 7-second user drag guard in [`game/public/app.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/app.js#L1400-L1415). When you drag the map, auto-center temporarily pauses so you can freely look around.
3. **Mid-Game Joiner Lobby Trap (Fixed)**:
   * *Problem*: Late joiners previously defaulted to rendering the lobby UI because `msg.roomState` did not match the lobby router.
   * *Fix*: Updated `case 'ROOM_JOINED'` in [`game/public/app.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/app.js#L355-L370) to detect active match states (`HEAD_START`, `THE_HUNT`, `EXTRACTION`) and launch the game screen immediately.
4. **Reconnection Socket Cleanup Lag (Fixed)**:
   * *Problem*: When a phone drops Wi-Fi or switches cell towers, the server socket may take several seconds to notice the TCP disconnect. If the player immediately re-opened the app, the server treated their name as "already taken".
   * *Fix*: Updated reconnection resolution in [`game/server.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/server.js#L388-L410) so matching player names instantly claim ownership and cleanly replace the stale socket.

