### 4. Answers to Your Questions & Field Guide

#### Q1: What do the zones mean (Extraction Omega, Sanctuary 3, Supply Outpost, Arena Hub)?
* **Extraction Omega (`EXTRACTION_ZONE`)**: The emergency extraction landing pad. It remains locked during early gameplay and unlocks automatically during the final 20% of the match. Living Survivors must run inside this zone to extract and win the game.
* **Sanctuary 3 / Supply Outpost (`HEALTH_PLUS_ZONE`)**: Safe utility points on the map where players can access the Powerup Shop to equip Cloak (stealth from radar) or Radar Extender sensors.
* **Arena Hub (`ARENA_CENTER`)**: The epicenter where the starting Zombies deploy at match launch.

#### Q2: What should I take care of while playing outdoor GPS survival?
1. **Location Settings**: Set Location/GPS to **High Accuracy** on all phones (GPS + Wi-Fi scanning enabled).
2. **Battery Optimization**: On OnePlus, Xiaomi/Redmi, and Samsung phones, set battery optimization for the app to **"Unrestricted"** so the OS doesn't throttle GPS when in pockets.
3. **Screen Sleep Prevention**: The app now activates the **Screen WakeLock API** automatically during match play so your phone screen will not go black while running.
4. **Physical Obstacles**: Always keep eyes on the physical environment while running, not just glued to the radar blips!


