### 3. How to Allow Players to Connect from Anywhere (Over 4G/5G Mobile Data)
If you want people to play while walking anywhere across the city on **Jio, Airtel, Vi, 4G/5G, or separate home Wi-Fi networks**, the server needs a **public internet address**.

There are two straightforward options:

#### Option A: Free Cloud Hosting (e.g. Render / Railway)
1. Host [`game/server.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/server.js) on a free hosting platform like **Render**, **Railway**, or **Fly.io**.
