#### Option B: Cloudflare Tunnel / Ngrok (Instant 1-Command Public URL)
You can instantly expose your local server to the whole world over 4G/5G using a free Cloudflare Tunnel:
```bash
cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:3000
```
This gives you an instant `https://xxxx.trycloudflare.com` public URL that works over any cellular or Wi-Fi network.

#### Option C: Supabase Realtime (Already Integrated in the Code)
The game already has a complete **Supabase Realtime** cloud bridge built into [`supabase-client.js`](file:///home/parth/MacProjects/Random/Reverse%20eng/game/public/supabase-client.js) pointing to project `https://ceyhsgzoouysumwfgqee.supabase.co`. Because Supabase operates on the public cloud, it works over any mobile network without needing local Wi-Fi.


